From 7decc1312bce9d202ddf74589ad41f7f112797ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:51:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 140/144] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: expose Dodge wireless
 diagnostics and limits

Keep the read-only gate/suspend diagnostics, snapshots, pause checks and wireless input limit handling together.

Consolidated from local follow-ups:
  948aaec0ce97ba3e783ccb6b38f45d0ac6723c69 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: add read-only Dodge normal gate diagnostic
  fa5884f3a2e628234fe4e83d00195ee234bbbf95 power: supply: nu1669: provide fresh generation-checked snapshots
  bc48b3da6f7e8cba2c1e6655f83211d039224d39 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: add owned normal-path charging pauses
  8a957893dc10094af024ae3e9197b1ee2880912b arm64: dts: qcom: link Dodge battery management to its receiver
  fb84f6caedcd3a73f343a0881868209753095c45 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: avoid the task macro in pause checks
  5bea5b76f5dfc36357d73f17b576e47bc357e3bc power: supply: qcom_battmgr: diagnose normal input suspend read-only
  ab62c1a16bd2327a37a8137ef9c3a6b7082d670f power: supply: qcom_battmgr: read wireless input current limit
---
